hat a surprise!", "start": 72.12, "end": 76.14, "who": "all", "kind": "sing", "section": "bridge1"}, {"text": "Curl up small like a cozy cat,", "start": 76.2, "end": 80.23, "who": "all", "kind": "sing", "section": "bridge1"}, {"text": "Yawn, yawn, yawn, imagine that!", "start": 80.36, "end": 84.58, "who": "all", "kind": "sing", "section": "bridge1"}, {"text": "The elephant can stand or lie,", "start": 85.26, "end": 88.46, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "verse3"}, {"text": "Under the big savanna sky!", "start": 89.94, "end": 92.9, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "verse3"}, {"text": "Milo sleeps up in his tree,", "start": 92.9, "end": 96.66, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "verse3"}, {"text": "Tucked in his nest, sleepy as can be!", "start": 96.66, "end": 100.78, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "verse3"}, {"text": "How do animals sleep at night?", "start": 100.84, "end": 105.7, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "chorus3"}, {"text": "Some lie down and some stand upright!", "start": 105.94, "end": 108.91, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "chorus3"}, {"text": "Close your eyes and count to three,", "start": 110.42, "end": 113.26, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "chorus3"}, {"text": "Sleepy zoo friends, just like me!", "start": 113.7, "end": 117.92, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "chorus3"}, {"text": "Goodnight, zoo friends! Bye-bye, friends!", "start": 117.97, "end": 120.22, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "outro1"}, {"text": "How do animals sleep at night?", "start": 136.38, "end": 140.16, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "outro1", "extra": true}, {"text": "Some lie down and some stand upright.", "start": 141.21, "end": 144.24, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "outro1", "extra": true}, {"text": "Close your eyes and count two, three.", "start": 145.43, "end": 148.42, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "outro1", "extra": true}, {"text": "Sleepies or friends, ju